al school  during World War One Dr Fate and several  other Heroes including Adam The Flash  Specter Green Lantern Hawkman Sandman  and our man were persuaded by President  Roosevelt to form the Justice Society of  America after Adam saved his life fate  inspector also managed to close a portal  to the demon realm during this time  defeating the elder god koth shukoff the  god of wrath's powers at one point in  the early 40s to curb naboo's invasive  control over his body Kent made himself  a half helmet replica of the Helm of  fate and instead drew his powers from  The Amulet of Anubis and the cloak of  Destiny back in 2030 BC Anubis granted  Kelis an evil priest his most prized  artifact and he used it to enslave the  people of Egypt for many years  thankfully Naboo thought that this was  [ __ ] so he confiscated The Amulet  and turned kalis into a mummy one of the  cooler aspects of this particular  artifact is that it has its own pocket  Universe it's also revealed later to  trap The Souls of Fallen Dr Fate hosts  in 1942's All-Star Squadron number 23  Kent went back to wearing the helm  estate to revert to his full power in an  attempt to find his missing JSA teammate  Specter not long after the Helm of Fate  was lost when it and the evil priest  kulak were thrown into Infinite  Dimensions between this point and the  60s Kent would use his half-helmed  Persona sparingly eventually retiring  from crime fighting at some point during  this period Kent was reunited with the  Helm of Fate off page and was wearing it  again when DC dusted him offers in  publication return to 1963's Justice  League of America number 21. in the 80s  Ken's relationship with Naboo interfered  with his marriage to inza and naboo's  enemies the Lords of chaos would use  this to their advantage to manipulate  enza into breaking Kent's heart in a bid  to retain his power to build and boob  an event to retain his power Naboo  absorbed inza into the Dr Fate Persona  against her wishes this was 